WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:22.445
Going away? Open Quick update.

2
00:00:22.445 --> 00:00:27.254
Press I am away for a while.

3
00:00:27.254 --> 00:00:30.184
The first day away is optional.

4
00:00:30.184 --> 00:00:33.113
Pick the last day you are away.

5
00:00:33.113 --> 00:00:36.031
Press Put it on my website.

6
00:00:36.031 --> 00:00:40.147
People read it before they ask for a quote.
